From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:32:22 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] spell: search the suite's shared dictionaries folder
 (settings spell_dictionaries, install folder)

spell::add_search_dir lets the overlay add folders without environment variables (set_var is unsafe in edition 2024 and the UI crate forbids unsafe).
office_overlay::use_shared_dictionaries adds the folder the shared spell_dictionaries setting names, then dictionaries/ next to the exe, then
the repository's assets/dictionaries (a development build), once at start-up. The web build and the tests keep the checker's own folders.
